  "conversion_timestamp": "2026-02-06T22:57:11.791259",
  "status": "error",
  "error": "Metadata model creation failed: {'error': 'Unknown metadata model creation status: RECEIVED'}",
  "error_timestamp": "2026-02-06T22:57:16.185142"
}

Manual Conversion Applied:
- CTEs (WITH clause) are fully compatible with PostgreSQL
- Window functions (AVG OVER, COUNT OVER) are compatible with PostgreSQL
- CASE expressions are compatible
- ROUND function is compatible
- Result: No syntax changes needed - statement is PostgreSQL compatible as-is

