Manual Conversion Applied:
Key PostgreSQL Changes:
1. BEGIN TRANSACTION → BEGIN
2. DECIMAL(18,2) → NUMERIC(18,2) (PostgreSQL standard)
3. GETDATE() → CURRENT_TIMESTAMP (3 occurrences)

